{"product":{"id":7413068398635,"title":"Smoked Golden Whitefish Roe","body_html":"\u003cp class=\"editable-text\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"\u003eGolden Whitefish roe from the Great Lakes region is known for its small grains, vibrant golden color, and soft yet crunchy texture. It is enhanced with the natural cold-smoke from bourbon barrel oak wood chips, which imparts a remarkable smoky essence to the roe’s crisp, clean flavor. Caviar and roe connoisseurs will enjoy expanding their culinary horizons with this gourmet fish roe, sourced from the cold waters of the Great Lakes. Perfect for sushi or adding depth of flavor to any seafood dish.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp id=\"wsite-com-product-title\" class=\"editable-text\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"\u003eEach jar is hand-packed and carefully inspected for optimal color, size, freshness, flavor, and texture. For additional details on shipping, usage, and privacy policies, please visit our Policy Page \u003ca href=\"\/pages\/policies\"\u003ePolicy Page\u003c\/a\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Caviar Star","product_type":"physical","created_at":"2025-07-11T03:59:53-04:00","handle":"smoked-golden-whitefish-caviar","updated_at":"2026-10-06T06:18:46-04:00","published_at":"2025-07-11T03:59:54-04:00","template_suffix":"caviar-variants","published_scope":"global","tags":"American Caviar, Domestic Caviar, Golden, Golden Caviar, Golden Whitefish, non-sturgeon, non-sturgeon roe, Smoked, Smoked Caviar, Whitefish, Whitefish Caviar","variants":[{"id":41890808725547,"product_id":7413068398635,"title":"2oz","price":"17.00","sku":"WFSM2","position":1,"compare_at_price":"20.00","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"2oz","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2025-07-11T03:59:53-04:00","updated_at":"2026-10-06T06:18:46-04:00","taxable":false,"barcode":"713336003262","grams":168,"image_id":null,"weight":0.37,"wei